"imperative", "pronoun": "anti", "arabic": "مَكِّنِي", "plain": "مَكِّنِي", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/3fc87b8dc4edb98d6ef2.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antuma", "arabic": "مَكِّنَا", "plain": "مَكِّنَا", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/2c784f4e97c7b523bde6.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "arabic": "مَكِّنُوا", "plain": "مَكِّنُوا", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/ab95154dea637745574b.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antunna", "arabic": "مَكِّنَّ", "plain": "مَكِّنَّ", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/cf5b22bea484d0adf0b3.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}], "ayat": [{"ref": "18:84", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "nahnu", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/2224.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Lo! We made him strong in the land and gave him unto every thing a road.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Gerçekten biz onu (Zülkarneyn'i) yeryüzünde iktidar sahibi yaptık ve ona ulaşmak istediği her şeyi elde etmesinin bir yolunu verdik.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "بیشک ہم نے اسے زمین میں قابو دیا اور ہر چیز کا ایک سامان عطا فرمایا", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Sesungguhnya Kami telah memberi kekuasaan kepadanya di (muka) bumi, dan Kami telah memberikan kepadanya jalan (untuk mencapai) segala sesuatu,", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "إِنَّا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مَكَّنَّا", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/a97bf30a16181dee89b4.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "učvrstili smo", "en": "We established", "tr": "yerleştirdik", "fr": "Nous avons établi", "id": "Kami meneguhkan", "ur": "ہم نے اقتدار دیا", "bn": "আমরা প্রতিষ্ঠিত করেছি", "fa": "جای دادیم"}}, {"text": "لَهُۥ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فِى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْأَرْضِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَءَاتَيْنَٰهُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مِن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "كُلِّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "شَىْءٍ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "سَبَبًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "28:6", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "nahnu", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/3258.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And to establish them in the earth, and to show Pharaoh and Haman and their hosts that which they feared from them.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Ve o yerde onları hakim kılalım, Firavun ile Hâmân ve ordularına, onlardan çekinmekte oldukları şeyi gösterelim.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور انہیں زمین میں قبضہ دیں اور فرعون اور ہامان اور ان کے لشکروں کو وہی دکھادیں جس کا انہیں ان کی طرف سے خطرہ ہے", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "dan akan Kami teguhkan kedudukan mereka di muka bumi dan akan Kami perlihatkan kepada Fir'aun dan Haman beserta tentaranya apa yang selalu mereka khawatirkan dari mereka itu.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَنُمَكِّنَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/10d729a5640717d22eb3.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "i da učvrstimo", "en": "and to establish", "tr": "ve yerleştirmek için", "fr": "et pour établir", "id": "dan untuk menegakkan", "ur": "اور تاکہ ہم اقتدار دیں", "bn": "এবং প্রতিষ্ঠিত করার জন্য", "fa": "و (تا) جای دهیم"}}, {"text": "لَهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فِى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْأَرْضِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَنُرِىَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فِرْعَوْنَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَهَٰمَٰنَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَجُنُودَهُمَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مِنْهُم", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مَّا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "كَانُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَحْذَرُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "18:95", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/2235.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "He said: That wherein my Lord hath established me is better (than your tribute). Do but help me with strength (of men), I will set between you and them a bank.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Dedi ki: \"Rabbimin bana vermiş olduğu servet ve saltanat, sizin vereceğiniz şeyden daha hayırlıdır. Bana maddî yardımda bulunun da sizinle onların arasına en sağlam seddi yapayım.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "کہا وہ جس پر مجھے میرے رب نے قابو دیا ہے بہتر ہے تو میری مدد طاقت سے کرو میں تم میں اور ان میں ایک مضبوط آڑ بنادوں", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dzulkarnain berkata: \"Apa yang telah dikuasakan oleh Tuhanku kepadaku terhadapnya adalah lebih baik, maka tolonglah aku dengan kekuatan (manusia dan alat-alat), agar aku membuatkan dinding antara kamu dan mereka,", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "قَالَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مَكَّنِّى", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/874a3fe84bdbaa00988e.m4a", "